            "role": "user",
            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What were the user's past collaborative experiences and feelings about artistic direction?\",\"output_slot\":\"collab_experience\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What were the user's past collaborative experiences and feelings about artistic direction?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"55c256bd241d9db749c1883077a1d114378a35c19265e81bcedd8d28ab6a4e94\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"49fd38a3c44249146f03dc8becc010b671ecabc34d788d380344569d6873f093\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"a2df3dd4f4f4b4a73c73c37b50e905870d5f7894c02e3bff3bee37f56d6e7617\"},\"variables\":{\"collab_experience\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"collab_experience\",\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"collab_experience\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"collab_experience\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_0b2b565db4144ab0613cb69e\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has had mixed collaborative experiences. They enjoyed a positive collaboration blending traditional Pacific sounds with modern beats, finding it vibrant and rewarding. However, they also faced significant challenges: a chaotic 2019 jam session that felt stressful and unproductive, feeling intimidated and lost in complex music theory discussions, and experiencing friction and stifled creativity in a band due to differing artistic visions, which led them to leave the band to pursue more autonomous creative work.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s31\",\"s24\",\"s3\",\"s23\",\"s32\",\"s4\",\"s5\",\"s14\",\"s30\",\"s15\",\"s13\",\"s33\",\"s16\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations describe both positive and negative collaborative experiences. Positive: collaborating with a local musician to blend traditional Pacific sounds with modern beats (s30-s33). Negative: a chaotic 2019 jam session (s13-s16), feeling intimidated in music theory discussions (s23-s24), and friction with a band over artistic direction leading to leaving the band (s4-s5). The original question's description of stifling band disagreements is consistent with s4-s5. The summary synthesizes these compatible facts into one whole account.\",\"variable\":\"collab_experience\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",107,477,\"User: It was exhilarating to showcase how our traditional sounds can coexist with modern elements, creating a beautiful and harmonious blend that resonates with a wide audience. The experience of seeing people connect with the music on a deeper level was something that I had always dreamed of achieving, as it brings the rich tapestry of our cultural heritage to life. \",\"user\",[157]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",477,827,\"However, I’ve had some challenges collaborating with other musicians, primarily stemming from differing artistic visions and contrasting approaches to the creative process. Each artist brings their unique style and preferences to the table, which can sometimes create friction rather than synergy, and that has been a tough pill to swallow at times. \",\"user\",[157]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",827,1008,\"It's disheartening when a collaboration that seems so promising on paper starts to unravel due to these differences, leaving me to ponder the best way forward in my musical journey.\",\"user\",[157]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",105,471,\"User: I organized a jam session in 2019, but it ended up chaotic and unproductive. There were several musicians with varying skill levels, and while the diversity was exciting, it also led to miscommunications about what we wanted to achieve together. With different genres and playing styles clashing, it was hard to find common ground and create a cohesive sound. \",\"user\",[34,35]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",471,796,\"I remember feeling overwhelmed as I tried to harmonize our efforts, but too many ideas collided at once, leaving us frustrated. Despite the initial enthusiasm, it quickly turned into a scramble of discordant notes and missed cues.\\n\\nUser: It felt more stressful than enjoyable, so I decided to rethink collaborative meetings. \",\"user\",[34,35]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",796,1062,\"The chaotic nature of that session really took me by surprise, as I had envisioned it as a way to foster creativity and bring fresh ideas to the table. Instead, it turned into a cacophony of differing opinions and lack of direction, where not much was accomplished. \",\"user\",[34,35]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",1062,1372,\"I realized that sometimes, too many voices can drown out the clarity needed to reach a consensus or develop a meaningful project together. So now, I'm on a journey to redefine how I approach group collaborations, aiming for a more structured and fulfilling process that nurtures rather than stifles creativity.\",\"user\",[34,35]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",105,425,\"User: The discussions were intense, and I felt lost in the crowd. I wanted to engage, but everyone seemed to have a deeper understanding of music theory than I did. The sheer volume of opinions and knowledge being shared left me intimidated, as if I were standing at the edge of an ocean of information, unable to swim. \",\"user\",[32]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",425,737,\"It was also challenging to keep track of so many different conversations happening at once, which made me hesitate to contribute anything meaningful. I often found myself reading the discussions late into the night, trying to absorb as much as possible, but the complexity just compounded my sense of disconnect.\",\"user\",[32]],[\"s30\",\"d4\",105,441,\"User: Yes, I collaborated with a local musician to blend traditional Pacific sounds with modern beats for a new track. Our sessions were filled with vibrant discussions about the cultural significance of the instruments we were using, such as the ukulele and various percussion instruments that are synonymous with the Pacific Islands. \",\"user\",[67,68]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",441,744,\"It was fascinating to delve into the history of each sound and explore how we could infuse contemporary rhythms that resonate with today's audiences. We spent hours experimenting in the studio, layering tracks and harmonizing melodies, aiming to strike that balance between authenticity and innovation. \",\"user\",[67,68]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",744,1104,\"The result, I believe, will not only honor our roots but also attract listeners from different backgrounds who might find something relatable in the music.\\n\\nUser: We're having such a great time experimenting with different sounds and styles. This process has opened up a world of creativity for us, where we can explore various cultural influences and genres. \",\"user\",[67,68]],[\"s33\",\"d4\",1104,1464,\"It’s fascinating how the blending of these distinct elements enables us to craft something totally unique. Each experimental session reveals new dimensions of our musical capabilities, and it feels incredibly rewarding to witness our progress. Overall, it's not just about creating music; it's about expressing our personal journeys and emotions through sound.\",\"user\",[67,68]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",2413,2670,\"While documentaries can provide insights and inspiration, they may not have the same emotional weight as hearing your own creations come to life, as they can't replicate the enriching experience of your own artistic journey and how it unfolds in real time. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",2074,2413,\"The importance of self-expression through music cannot be overstated; it serves not only as a form of art but also as a therapeutic outlet. The reason documentaries can sometimes feel lacking is that they often offer an external perspective, stripping away the intimate connection that comes from creating something personally meaningful. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",2670,2896,\"It's essential to honor that desire to create authentically, for it's in those moments of genuine expression that true artistry emerges, transforming mere sounds into something transcendent that can touch the hearts of others.\",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s49\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 83–85 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s50\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",105,432,\"User: Yes! I actually joined a local band that focuses on fusing traditional and contemporary styles.\\n\\nUser: It's been amazing to work alongside others who share my passion for blending different music traditions. The dynamic interactions have sparked new ideas and fueled our creativity as we explore various genres together. \",\"user\",[83,84]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",432,735,\"We've been experimenting with a mix of instruments, from traditional strumming of acoustic guitars to the pulsating rhythms produced by electronic synthesizers. It's fascinating to see how each musician brings their unique background and influences into the mix, which creates a rich tapestry of sound. \",\"user\",[83,84]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",735,856,\"This collaborative atmosphere not only enhances our musical output but also strengthens our bonds as artists and friends.\",\"user\",[83,84]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",856,869,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",869,1264,\"Assistant: Collaboration can really elevate your work! When musicians come together with a shared vision, the results can be truly magnificent, and it often leads to discoveries that one might not achieve solo. This synergy between artists allows for a blending of various elements, which can propel creativity to new heights, unleashing innovations that may resonate profoundly with audiences. \",\"assistant\",[85]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",1264,1618,\"Moreover, the process itself fosters a sense of community, making the practice of making music even more rewarding and enjoyable. Have you had the chance to engage in any discussions about the cultural significance of the styles you’re merging? Such conversations can deepen the understanding of the art and enhance the richness of your interpretations. \",\"assistant\",[85]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",1618,1676,\"Speaking of which, have you done any music reviews lately?\",\"assistant\",[85]],[\"s58\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 43–44 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s59\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s60\",\"d7\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",845,858,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",858,1223,\"Assistant: That’s an inspiring mindset! The journey of creating one's own music can be immensely fulfilling, as it allows for a deep personal expression that often transcends verbal communication. Have you tried composing original music? It can be an incredibly rewarding experience, as every note and lyric may reflect your thoughts and emotions in a genuine way. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s64\",\"d7\",1223,1407,\"Crafting melodies and harmonies also provides a unique outlet to process your own experiences and feelings; oftentimes, that raw authenticity resonates more than polished productions. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s65\",\"d7\",1407,1725,\"I understand that it can initially feel daunting, especially considering the plethora of skilled musicians out there, but remember that each artist started somewhere, often experimenting and learning through the process. It’s perfectly natural to encounter challenges, as the act of creation is rarely linear or easy. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s66\",\"d7\",1725,2062,\"Perhaps approaching it with a spirit of playfulness rather than obligation could rekindle that joy you're seeking. It's about discovering what resonates with you personally and allowing your creativity to flow. You might find that sometimes, the act of making music, irrespective of the final outcome, is what truly nurtures your spirit.\",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s67\",\"d8\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 24–25 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s68\",\"d8\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s69\",\"d8\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s70\",\"d8\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s71\",\"d8\",767,780,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s72\",\"d8\",780,1161,\"Assistant: That’s a great insight! It’s important to focus on what you love. Music is such a personal journey, and it should evoke joy rather than feelings of obligation or frustration. Understanding the theory can certainly enhance one’s appreciation, but if it detracts from the experience, it’s wise to step back. Have you tried any other forms of music exploration since then? \",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s73\",\"d8\",1161,1499,\"There are so many avenues to experience music, whether it's attending live performances, discovering underground artists, or even engaging in creative collaborations. Each of these can rekindle your passion and allow for a fresh appreciation of the art form, helping you reconnect with what initially drew you to music in the first place.\",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s74\",\"d9\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 81–82 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s75\",\"d9\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s76\",\"d9\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s77\",\"d9\",344,695,\"Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s78\",\"d9\",695,817,\"This blending of natural elements with melody has truly rejuvenated my passion for creating and sharing music with others.\",\"user\",[81]],[\"s79\",\"d9\",817,830,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s80\",\"d9\",830,1178,\"Assistant: That sounds beautiful! Nature can inspire such unique musical elements, providing textures and layers that are often hard to replicate with traditional instruments alone. It’s fascinating how something as simple as the rustling of leaves or the chirping of birds can evoke powerful emotions and influence the direction of a composition. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s81\",\"d9\",1178,1415,\"Have you thought about collaborating with other musicians on this? Working with others who share your passion for blending genres can lead to remarkable synergies, where each artist’s strengths complement one another in unexpected ways. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s82\",\"d9\",1415,1777,\"Collaborations can also introduce you to new techniques, sounds, and ideas that could elevate your projects even further, especially in a band setting where different styles can creatively clash and harmonize. Plus, sharing your musical journey with others can lead to a richer experience, as you exchange not just sounds but stories behind every note and beat. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s83\",\"d9\",1777,1897,\"I would love to learn more about your experiences in these collaborations and how they impact your music-making process.\",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s84\",\"d10\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 29–31 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s85\",\"d10\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s86\",\"d10\",105,368,\"User: I tried reviewing an album in 2019, but that didn't stick either, as it felt unproductive. I think I was attempting to analyze the music in a way that didn't align with my natural style, which is often more spontaneous and emotional rather than analytical. \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s87\",\"d10\",368,648,\"The process felt like I was forcing myself to conform to a template, which drained the fun out of it, as I was trying to fit into a mold that didn't suit me. It was disheartening because I love music in its truest form, without rigid guidelines dictating how I should dissect it. \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s88\",\"d10\",648,906,\"This experience prompted me to consider alternative methods of connecting with music, such as sharing my playlists or even discussing music with friends, rather than feeling pressured to produce polished reviews.\\n\\nUser: There’s just so much more to explore! \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s89\",\"d10\",906,1276,\"Joining an online music community felt like opening a door to an entire universe of sounds, genres, and artists that I had either never encountered or really only skimmed the surface of before. With each click, I was greeted by recommendations that spanned from obscure indie bands to historical records of jazz legends that have shaped the music landscape for decades. \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s90\",\"d10\",1276,1603,\"It was exhilarating to discover how many styles there are, whether it's the evolving sound of electronic music or the soulful richness of classical compositions. However, despite this vast array of choices, the sheer volume of content often left me feeling inundated and unsure of where to focus my limited time and attention. \",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s91\",\"d10\",1603,1800,\"I remember browsing through discussions that stretched on for pages about new releases or vintage hits, and it sometimes felt daunting to keep up with everyone’s excitement and extensive knowledge.\",\"user\",[29,30]],[\"s92\",\"d10\",1800,1813,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s93\",\"d10\",1813,2150,\"Assistant: I completely understand the overwhelming sensation you're describing when diving into an online music community; it truly resembles trying to drink from a fire hydrant! Each new member brings their unique experiences, insights, and preferences, which can enrich the conversation but also complicate one’s own musical journey. \",\"assistant\",[31]],[\"s94\",\"d10\",2150,2435,\"The thrill of discovering new artists and genres can be heightened by the thoughtful discussions and recommendations shared amongst fellow music lovers, yet, paradoxically, this can also create a sense of pressure to explore every recommendation and participate in every conversation. \",\"assistant\",[31]],[\"s95\",\"d10\",2435,2686,\"This fine balance between gaining knowledge and feeling lost is part and parcel of engaging with such a lively environment; in essence, it’s important to remember that music exploration should be a joy, not just a checklist of albums to keep up with. \",\"assistant\",[31]],[\"s96\",\"d10\",2686,2918,\"Embracing the process of discovery without the burden of expectation can lead to a much more fulfilling experience, where you can savor each new sound pattern at your own pace and truly appreciate what resonates with you personally.\",\"assistant\",[31]],[\"s97\",\"d11\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 18–20 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s98\",\"d11\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s99\",\"d11\",105,345,\"User: Absolutely! Collaborating with local musicians for a fusion concert in 2016 was another milestone for me. The blend of different musical styles brought a fresh dynamic to my performances, allowing me to explore new sonic territories. \",\"user\",[18,19]],[\"s100\",\"d11\",345,728,\"It was exhilarating to combine elements from various genres, which not only challenged me as a musician but also enriched the listening experience for the audience. We spent countless hours fine-tuning our arrangements, diving deep into each other's musical backgrounds, and discovering unique ways to intertwine our individual sounds to create something truly cohesive and special. \",\"user\",[18,19]],[\"s101\",\"d11\",728,1020,\"That concert remains one of my fondest memories, as it encapsulated the spirit of collaboration and creativity that music embodies.\\n\\nUser: Those collaborations really expanded my horizons! It's remarkable how working with different artists can bring new elements into your own musical style. \",\"user\",[18,19]],[\"s102\",\"d11\",1020,1388,\"Each collaboration can introduce unique instruments, rhythms, or influences, which can fundamentally transform a piece of music. It's like a beautiful tapestry of sound where various threads intertwine to create something truly special. This process not only enhances the music but also broadens your understanding of different genres and cultures within the art form.\",\"user\",[18,19]],[\"s103\",\"d11\",1388,1401,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s104\",\"d11\",1401,1648,\"Assistant: It must be fascinating to see your music evolve through collaboration. I can imagine how rewarding it is to witness the blending of different artistic styles and perspectives, shaping the final outcome into something fresh and vibrant. \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s105\",\"d11\",1648,2013,\"Collaborations can create an atmosphere of creativity that fosters risk-taking and innovation, allowing both parties to step outside their comfort zones. Additionally, attending live concerts is an essential aspect for many musicians, as it provides inspiration and insight into the audience's reactions and preferences. Have you continued attending live concerts? \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s106\",\"d11\",2013,2346,\"They can be such an incredible source of motivation, and being surrounded by passionate fellow music lovers elevates the experience even further. There's something uniquely powerful about the energy in a crowded venue, where every note played reverberates not just in the air but also through the collective spirit of those present. \",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s107\",\"d11\",2346,2445,\"It's a transcendent experience that can deeply influence one's own artistry and direction in music.\",\"assistant\",[20]],[\"s108\",\"d12\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 3–4 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s109\",\"d12\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s110\",\"d12\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s111\",\"d12\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s112\",\"d12\",611,624,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s113\",\"d12\",624,897,\"Assistant: That sounds amazing! Mixing creativity with technology can lead to some unique sounds. The fusion of various musical elements often results in innovative and fresh auditory experiences that can truly captivate listeners. Have you continued with digital remixes? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s114\",\"d12\",897,1191,\"Exploring this world further can open doors to many exciting opportunities, as the music landscape constantly evolves with new trends and technology. It's so fulfilling to be part of a community where collaboration allows artists to push boundaries and inspire one another, wouldn't you agree? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s115\",\"d12\",1191,1447,\"I’d love to hear more about any specific projects or genres you gravitated toward after your initial foray into digital remixing. Music has such a profound ability to connect us, and it's wonderful to share those moments with others who share your passion.\",\"assistant\",[4]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"collab_experience\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_0b2b565db4144ab0613cb69e\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s31\",\"s24\",\"s3\",\"s23\",\"s32\",\"s4\",\"s5\",\"s14\",\"s30\",\"s15\",\"s13\",\"s33\",\"s16\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:bf772f167994aa30c86a0cdbb17bd6ac685a7b4a90f14531edd269d509c156c0\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":157.0,\"observed_end\":158.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:b5e1263c95ab30379557a3a3c06282519d918edcb15b5db683639831126eb309\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":34.0,\"observed_end\":36.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:1e25adff704ead47c95acde5264cec79a0bc3ccf381f2f71216335197abde621\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":32.0,\"observed_end\":33.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:d30a6dc4e11d34f7f06ae8ecb58b79cab966b77736