            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"output_slot\":\"response\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[\"collab_experience\",\"autonomy_pref\"],\"execution\":\"compose\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"01ffe45aef4d296095eda30a7243a91fd04fde636d7f3805230f54f071a7c407\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"49fd38a3c44249146f03dc8becc010b671ecabc34d788d380344569d6873f093\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"a2df3dd4f4f4b4a73c73c37b50e905870d5f7894c02e3bff3bee37f56d6e7617\"},\"variables\":{\"collab_experience\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"collab_experience\",\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"autonomy_pref\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"autonomy_pref\",\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"response\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"response\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"collab_experience\",\"autonomy_pref\",\"response\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"collab_experience\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"autonomy_pref\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"response\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{\"collab_experience\":{\"value\":\"The user has had mixed collaborative experiences. They enjoyed a positive collaboration blending traditional Pacific sounds with modern beats, finding it vibrant and rewarding. However, they also faced significant challenges: a chaotic 2019 jam session that felt stressful and unproductive, feeling intimidated and lost in complex music theory discussions, and experiencing friction and stifled creativity in a band due to differing artistic visions, which led them to leave the band to pursue more autonomous creative work.\",\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s31\",\"s24\",\"s3\",\"s23\",\"s32\",\"s4\",\"s5\",\"s14\",\"s30\",\"s15\",\"s13\",\"s33\",\"s16\"],\"demand\":\"collab_experience\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"autonomy_pref\":{\"value\":\"The user currently prefers and desires creative autonomy, seeking to work independently on personal music projects that allow for authentic self-expression, emotional connection, and personal growth, having been discouraged by past collaborative conflicts and feeling more fulfilled when creating alone.\",\"version\":1,\"source_ids\":[\"s60\",\"s61\",\"s4\",\"s42\",\"s5\",\"s43\",\"s39\",\"s41\",\"s40\"],\"demand\":\"autonomy_pref\",\"type\":\"text\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_0b2b565db4144ab0613cb69e\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has had mixed collaborative experiences. They enjoyed a positive collaboration blending traditional Pacific sounds with modern beats, finding it vibrant and rewarding. However, they also faced significant challenges: a chaotic 2019 jam session that felt stressful and unproductive, feeling intimidated and lost in complex music theory discussions, and experiencing friction and stifled creativity in a band due to differing artistic visions, which led them to leave the band to pursue more autonomous creative work.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s31\",\"s24\",\"s3\",\"s23\",\"s32\",\"s4\",\"s5\",\"s14\",\"s30\",\"s15\",\"s13\",\"s33\",\"s16\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations describe both positive and negative collaborative experiences. Positive: collaborating with a local musician to blend traditional Pacific sounds with modern beats (s30-s33). Negative: a chaotic 2019 jam session (s13-s16), feeling intimidated in music theory discussions (s23-s24), and friction with a band over artistic direction leading to leaving the band (s4-s5). The original question's description of stifling band disagreements is consistent with s4-s5. The summary synthesizes these compatible facts into one whole account.\",\"variable\":\"collab_experience\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"},{\"id\":\"fact_928a9cee2f955304a6a858d9\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user currently prefers and desires creative autonomy, seeking to work independently on personal music projects that allow for authentic self-expression, emotional connection, and personal growth, having been discouraged by past collaborative conflicts and feeling more fulfilled when creating alone.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s60\",\"s61\",\"s4\",\"s42\",\"s5\",\"s43\",\"s39\",\"s41\",\"s40\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user describes challenges with collaboration due to differing artistic visions (s4, s5), expresses that technical production did not resonate and that true passion lies in emotional connection and creating personal tracks (s39, s40, s41, s42, s43), and contrasts passive consumption (documentary) with the deeper engagement of personal creation (s60, s61). These statements collectively support a current preference for autonomous, independent creative work.\",\"variable\":\"autonomy_pref\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"},{\"id\":\"fact_a6c71e91466ce04d07052e6b\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"I understand that initially, you enjoyed collaborating with other musicians, finding it an enriching creative experience. However, over time, your preferences evolved due to feeling stifled by disagreements over artistic direction. This led to a shift away from collaboration, as you felt constrained and questioned your artistic abilities and instincts. Your journey reflects a transition from a collaborative approach to seeking independence in order to pursue your creative endeavors in a manner that resonates with your artistic essence.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s60\",\"s31\",\"s61\",\"s24\",\"s3\",\"s23\",\"s32\",\"s4\",\"s42\",\"s5\",\"s43\",\"s14\",\"s30\",\"s15\",\"s39\",\"s13\",\"s41\",\"s33\",\"s40\",\"s16\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{\"collab_experience\":1,\"autonomy_pref\":1},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's history shows a positive early collaboration (s30-s33) and later negative experiences (s4-s5, s13-s16, s23-s24) that led to a desire for autonomy (s39-s43, s60-s61). Option (a) accurately reflects this progression from initial enjoyment to stifling conflict to seeking independence, matching the user's own narrative and supported preferences. The other options misrepresent the timeline or suggest a return to collaboration that is not supported by the evidence.\",\"variable\":\"response\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",107,477,\"User: It was exhilarating to showcase how our traditional sounds can coexist with modern elements, creating a beautiful and harmonious blend that resonates with a wide audience. The experience of seeing people connect with the music on a deeper level was something that I had always dreamed of achieving, as it brings the rich tapestry of our cultural heritage to life. \",\"user\",[157]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",477,827,\"However, I’ve had some challenges collaborating with other musicians, primarily stemming from differing artistic visions and contrasting approaches to the creative process. Each artist brings their unique style and preferences to the table, which can sometimes create friction rather than synergy, and that has been a tough pill to swallow at times. \",\"user\",[157]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",827,1008,\"It's disheartening when a collaboration that seems so promising on paper starts to unravel due to these differences, leaving me to ponder the best way forward in my musical journey.\",\"user\",[157]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",105,471,\"User: I organized a jam session in 2019, but it ended up chaotic and unproductive. There were several musicians with varying skill levels, and while the diversity was exciting, it also led to miscommunications about what we wanted to achieve together. With different genres and playing styles clashing, it was hard to find common ground and create a cohesive sound. \",\"user\",[34,35]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",471,796,\"I remember feeling overwhelmed as I tried to harmonize our efforts, but too many ideas collided at once, leaving us frustrated. Despite the initial enthusiasm, it quickly turned into a scramble of discordant notes and missed cues.\\n\\nUser: It felt more stressful than enjoyable, so I decided to rethink collaborative meetings. \",\"user\",[34,35]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",796,1062,\"The chaotic nature of that session really took me by surprise, as I had envisioned it as a way to foster creativity and bring fresh ideas to the table. Instead, it turned into a cacophony of differing opinions and lack of direction, where not much was accomplished. \",\"user\",[34,35]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",1062,1372,\"I realized that sometimes, too many voices can drown out the clarity needed to reach a consensus or develop a meaningful project together. So now, I'm on a journey to redefine how I approach group collaborations, aiming for a more structured and fulfilling process that nurtures rather than stifles creativity.\",\"user\",[34,35]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",105,425,\"User: The discussions were intense, and I felt lost in the crowd. I wanted to engage, but everyone seemed to have a deeper understanding of music theory than I did. The sheer volume of opinions and knowledge being shared left me intimidated, as if I were standing at the edge of an ocean of information, unable to swim. \",\"user\",[32]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",425,737,\"It was also challenging to keep track of so many different conversations happening at once, which made me hesitate to contribute anything meaningful. I often found myself reading the discussions late into the night, trying to absorb as much as possible, but the complexity just compounded my sense of disconnect.\",\"user\",[32]],[\"s30\",\"d4\",105,441,\"User: Yes, I collaborated with a local musician to blend traditional Pacific sounds with modern beats for a new track. Our sessions were filled with vibrant discussions about the cultural significance of the instruments we were using, such as the ukulele and various percussion instruments that are synonymous with the Pacific Islands. \",\"user\",[67,68]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",441,744,\"It was fascinating to delve into the history of each sound and explore how we could infuse contemporary rhythms that resonate with today's audiences. We spent hours experimenting in the studio, layering tracks and harmonizing melodies, aiming to strike that balance between authenticity and innovation. \",\"user\",[67,68]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",744,1104,\"The result, I believe, will not only honor our roots but also attract listeners from different backgrounds who might find something relatable in the music.\\n\\nUser: We're having such a great time experimenting with different sounds and styles. This process has opened up a world of creativity for us, where we can explore various cultural influences and genres. \",\"user\",[67,68]],[\"s33\",\"d4\",1104,1464,\"It’s fascinating how the blending of these distinct elements enables us to craft something totally unique. Each experimental session reveals new dimensions of our musical capabilities, and it feels incredibly rewarding to witness our progress. Overall, it's not just about creating music; it's about expressing our personal journeys and emotions through sound.\",\"user\",[67,68]],[\"s39\",\"d5\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s40\",\"d5\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s41\",\"d5\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s42\",\"d5\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s60\",\"d6\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s61\",\"d6\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s1\",\"d1\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 157–158 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s2\",\"d1\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1008,1021,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1021,1416,\"Assistant: Collaborating can be both rewarding and frustrating, a dual-edged sword that every musician faces at some point in their career. The thrill of blending different ideas and perspectives often comes with the challenge of navigating conflicting priorities and creative disagreements. What happened specifically in your collaboration that led to your decision to part ways with the band? \",\"assistant\",[158]],[\"s8\",\"d1\",1416,1811,\"I can imagine the emotions must have run high if you felt the need to break away, as it's never easy to step back from a group dynamic that you've invested time and energy into. While it might feel disheartening now, this could also be a crucial turning point for you, providing an opportunity to focus on your personal artistry and explore new avenues that align more closely with your vision. \",\"assistant\",[158]],[\"s9\",\"d1\",1811,2184,\"Perhaps this is your chance to forge a unique sound that represents your identity without compromise, harnessing the lessons learned from your previous experiences to inform your new direction and approach. The resilience that comes from overcoming such hurdles will undoubtedly enrich your future projects, giving them depth and authenticity that stems from your journey. \",\"assistant\",[158]],[\"s10\",\"d1\",2184,2402,\"It's essential to remember that every setback is just a setup for a more significant comeback, and the creative landscape is vast; there are endless possibilities waiting for you once you rediscover your artistic path.\",\"assistant\",[158]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 34–36 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",1372,1385,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",1385,1778,\"Assistant: It’s wise to prioritize quality over quantity. While collaborative meetings can be a powerful tool for innovation and teamwork, the environment must be conducive for it to be effective. Have you explored music history at all? Understanding the different movements and trends in music may offer valuable insights into collaboration styles through various genres and their evolution. \",\"assistant\",[36]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",1778,2110,\"For example, the way jazz musicians spontaneously create music together often emphasizes listening and adaptability, which can be applied to other creative meetings. By dissecting the nuances of musical collaboration, you might discover strategies to enhance your own group interactions and create a more harmonious blend of ideas. \",\"assistant\",[36]],[\"s20\",\"d2\",2110,2315,\"It’s essential to remember that every historical epoch had its challenges, yet each also offered unique paths to extraordinary creativity, something that we can adapt to modern-day collaborative practices.\",\"assistant\",[36]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 32–33 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",737,750,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",750,1094,\"Assistant: That can be daunting. It’s probably better to find smaller, more personal avenues to share your music, where you can connect more deeply with others and feel less overshadowed. Many people find that intimate group settings foster a sense of safety that encourages sharing and collaboration without the pressure of a larger audience. \",\"assistant\",[33]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",1094,1446,\"In these environments, individuals often feel more empowered to express themselves and explore their creativity freely, leading to more productive interactions. Have you considered local meet-ups, smaller online groups, or even one-on-one sessions where you can receive constructive feedback in a supportive atmosphere? How did you handle jam sessions?\",\"assistant\",[33]],[\"s28\",\"d4\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 67–69 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s29\",\"d4\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",1464,1477,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",1477,1858,\"Assistant: Collaboration can really bring fresh perspectives! When artists come together, there’s an undeniable energy that often generates innovative ideas that may not have surfaced individually. This synergy can sometimes lead to unexpected results, turning musical concepts into entirely new soundscapes. Have you been learning any new techniques or skills while you’re at it? \",\"assistant\",[69]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",1858,2199,\"Embracing new methods often enhances one’s understanding of music production, helping to bridge gaps between genres and cultures. I’m genuinely interested in hearing about how this collaborative approach has influenced your work. It must feel incredibly fulfilling to share these experiences with others who have a similar passion for sound.\",\"assistant\",[69]],[\"s37\",\"d5\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 40–42 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s38\",\"d5\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",1686,1699,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",1699,2074,\"Assistant: I completely understand where you're coming from, as focusing on your personal inspirations can lead to much more fulfilling creative experiences. When you channel your energy into producing music that resonates with you, it sets the stage for a more meaningful artistic journey, one where every note and beat are imbued with your unique perspective and emotions. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",2074,2413,\"The importance of self-expression through music cannot be overstated; it serves not only as a form of art but also as a therapeutic outlet. The reason documentaries can sometimes feel lacking is that they often offer an external perspective, stripping away the intimate connection that comes from creating something personally meaningful. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",2413,2670,\"While documentaries can provide insights and inspiration, they may not have the same emotional weight as hearing your own creations come to life, as they can't replicate the enriching experience of your own artistic journey and how it unfolds in real time. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",2670,2896,\"It's essential to honor that desire to create authentically, for it's in those moments of genuine expression that true artistry emerges, transforming mere sounds into something transcendent that can touch the hearts of others.\",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s58\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 43–44 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s59\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s62\",\"d6\",845,858,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s63\",\"d6\",858,1223,\"Assistant: That’s an inspiring mindset! The journey of creating one's own music can be immensely fulfilling, as it allows for a deep personal expression that often transcends verbal communication. Have you tried composing original music? It can be an incredibly rewarding experience, as every note and lyric may reflect your thoughts and emotions in a genuine way. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s64\",\"d6\",1223,1407,\"Crafting melodies and harmonies also provides a unique outlet to process your own experiences and feelings; oftentimes, that raw authenticity resonates more than polished productions. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s65\",\"d6\",1407,1725,\"I understand that it can initially feel daunting, especially considering the plethora of skilled musicians out there, but remember that each artist started somewhere, often experimenting and learning through the process. It’s perfectly natural to encounter challenges, as the act of creation is rarely linear or easy. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s66\",\"d6\",1725,2062,\"Perhaps approaching it with a spirit of playfulness rather than obligation could rekindle that joy you're seeking. It's about discovering what resonates with you personally and allowing your creativity to flow. You might find that sometimes, the act of making music, irrespective of the final outcome, is what truly nurtures your spirit.\",\"assistant\",[44]]],\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"public_output_question\":\"After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"public_options\":[\"I understand that initially, you enjoyed collaborating with other musicians, finding it an enriching creative experience. However, over time, your preferences evolved due to feeling stifled by disagreements over artistic direction. This led to a shift away from collaboration, as you felt constrained and questioned your artistic abilities and instincts. Your journey reflects a transition from a collaborative approach to seeking independence in order to pursue your creative endeavors in a manner that resonates with your artistic essence.\",\"You initially felt constrained by disagreements over artistic direction, feeling stifled and questioning your artistic abilities and instincts. Afterwards, you went on to enjoy collaborating with other musicians, as it was an enriching creative experience, before ultimately seeking independence to pursue your creative endeavors.\",\"At first, you questioned your artistic abilities and instincts, feeling stifled by disagreements over artistic direction in collaborations. Nevertheless, over time, you began enjoying collaboration with other musicians as an enriching creative experience, before eventually transitioning to independence to fully resonate with your true creative essence.\",\"Initially, you felt constrained by disagreements over artistic direction, which made you question your artistic abilities and instincts. However, over time, you found collaborating with other musicians to be an enriching creative experience. This led to a shift towards collaboration, as you sought creative endeavors that resonate with your artistic essence.\"],\"terminal_expression\":{\"op\":\"var\",\"id\":\"response\"},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"response_audit\",\"audit_instruction\":\"Check actual facts and ALL known scoped counters against original sources. Return audit_verdict=supported only if checked with no unresolved relevant issue; unknown otherwise. Include sourced corrections/retractions before verdict. Verify the proposed terminal output without silently replacing its option label.\",\"terminal_candidate\":{\"value\":\"I understand that initially, you enjoyed collaborating with other musicians, finding it an enriching creative experience. However, over time, your preferences evolved due to feeling stifled by disagreements over artistic direction. This led to a shift away from collaboration, as you felt constrained and questioned your artistic abilities and instincts. Your journey reflects a transition from a collaborative approach to seeking independence in order to pursue your creative endeavors in a manner that resonates with your artistic essence.\",\"final_prediction\":\"a\"},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:bf772f167994aa30c86a0cdbb17bd6ac685a7b4a90f14531edd269d509c156c0\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":157.0,\"observed_end\":158.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:b5e1263c95ab30379557a3a3c06282519d918edcb15b5db683639831126eb309\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":34.0,\"observed_end\":36.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:1e25adff704ead47c95acde5264cec79a0bc3ccf381f2f71216335197abde621\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":32.0,\"observed_end\":33.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_s